    "detailed_description": "Now your problem isn't the number of bullets, rather the amount of time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n99Seconds, a fun, retro-style video game, where you can modify time to avoid all kinds of dangers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter finishing off Black Eye, V-99 entered a mysterious zone called Bit 8, without knowing why V-99 could modify time!. But everything became complicated with the appearance of the BLACK VECTORS: mysterious beings that aim to destroy any intruder who reaches Bit 8.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Online Ranking!<br />\r\n- Control V-99, dodging, using SLOW DOWN to slow !<br />\r\n- Arcade mobility like in the classic arcade games!<br />\r\n- 4 Players in Arcade and Survival mode!<br />\r\n- Retro-style levels!<br />\r\n- Incredible enemy patterns!",
    "about_the_game": "Now your problem isn't the number of bullets, rather the amount of time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n99Seconds, a fun, retro-style video game, where you can modify time to avoid all kinds of dangers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter finishing off Black Eye, V-99 entered a mysterious zone called Bit 8, without knowing why V-99 could modify time!. But everything became complicated with the appearance of the BLACK VECTORS: mysterious beings that aim to destroy any intruder who reaches Bit 8.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Online Ranking!<br />\r\n- Control V-99, dodging, using SLOW DOWN to slow !<br />\r\n- Arcade mobility like in the classic arcade games!<br />\r\n- 4 Players in Arcade and Survival mode!<br />\r\n- Retro-style levels!<br />\r\n- Incredible enemy patterns!",
    "short_description": "99Seconds, a fun, retro-style video game, where you can modify time to avoid all kinds of dangers.",
